{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2021-01", "window": 2, "start_date": 1610064000, "end_date": 1610755199, "month_true_total": 88, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:49:44 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "84736963", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997574335", "personaname": "Card Crusher", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197997574335/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 13749, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3606, "last_played": 1688174597, "avatar": "7351d83e8bc1ba0612f9f7b5a8c0904aeb128e46"}, "language": "english", "review": "My friends in a tank the size of a office building got launched into the air by a giant armadillo, which non-stop barrel-rolled across the map for a good 20 seconds, while I watched from the roof top of a 40 story building sniping gigantic bugs with dual wield no-recoil tank cannons.\n\nGreat co-op game, EDF/10, would play again", "timestamp_created": 1610729187, "timestamp_updated": 1610729187, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.612903237342834473", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "84693867", "author": {"steamid": "76561198123142565", "personaname": "Gawr Goomba", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/volter43/", "num_games_owned": 242, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 4211, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2508, "last_played": 1637289602, "avatar": "39d8210878104bc9b877e32cf8d4626c29783759"}, "language": "english", "review": "Disclaimer: Bought this game for half the price. DO NOT BUY THE GAME FOR THE FULL $60.\n\nWant a game to just mindlessly blast giant aliens and monsters with a vast arsenal of weapons, equipment, and vehicles, all while listening to a banger of a loadout screen OST? This is the game for you :)\n", "timestamp_created": 1610660862, "timestamp_updated": 1610660862, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "84692540", "author": {"steamid": "76561198195371094", "personaname": "MrGrim21", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TakeYourTime_Andrew/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 19038, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7874, "last_played": 1676334546, "avatar": "3264eb98d983b62854a08c6484930789771a008f"}, "language": "english", "review": "a great grind", "timestamp_created": 1610658889, "timestamp_updated": 1610658889, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "84661884", "author": {"steamid": "76561198124470300", "personaname": "RequiemOrReg", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198124470300/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 65822, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 42348, "last_played": 1710769825, "avatar": "db210981b66480a40e724ceb33c3358a2cc6c4e3"}, "language": "english", "review": "For PC Gamers. EDF 4.1 was Really Brutal, Teamwork was Recommended to Survive a lot of the Missions, the Weapons feel Underwhelming and the Enemies are no Pushovers. Grinding Armor Was Needed to Survive Inferno. And Even then You need Teamwork to Be able to Beat it. \n\nEDF 5 Wasn't As Much, With the Updated gameplay, Each Class Are More Unique in that They can Survive SO long as they keep a good Footing on the Classes they Used, Ranger Can Sprint out of Combat Area and Get to Safer Areas For Firing Support. Wing Diver Make Used Of Air Dash To avoid Enemies but Mainly to Fly Longer, Weapons are Rework to Charge Energy before Release instead of Using it Immediately so it Drains In Combat. Air Raider Bombing run is now More Effective then Ever, Mechs Have Bigger Health Pool, Some Weapons Firing Support Doesn't Use Credits but Instead Has Cooldowns, Best Part? It Sticks to Enemies. Fencers Are More Mobile Then Ever, Shield Becomes redundant as the Main Enemy this time around are Fast And Mobile, Fencers Are Really Good Crowd Control has they could Dash+Jump anywhere, \n\nSO Basically You can play however you wish and have fun without thinking too much about what you should not do that will mess up.", "timestamp_created": 1610618480, "timestamp_updated": 1610618480, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "84606205", "author": {"steamid": "76561198123811079", "personaname": "C2", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Lady-C2/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 2861, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 484, "last_played": 1759598431, "avatar": "1fe3db0941fe279b9f0fcd63e3bc63e0cfadd928"}, "language": "english", "review": "owo", "timestamp_created": 1610536627, "timestamp_updated": 1610536627, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}